    "detailed_description": "Minesweeper, but you only solve each situation once.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Regions (number bubbles connected by lines) generated from clues on the board<br></li><li>Rules act on regions to mark bombs, clear squares or create new regions<br></li><li>A checker tells you if your rule is formally correct<br></li><li>Rules are auto applied forever after, resolving the situations you have solved before<br></li><li>Only the hard situations remain.<br></li><li>A hint system can mark the determinable squares and remove all unnecessary regions from the board.<br></li><li>Regions can be hidden or discarded using rules<br></li><li>Thousands of levels to play, all solvable without guessing.</li></ul>",
